# Exact downstream request bytes, in order (step dividers)

### step 1: PUT http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/proxy-url (set socks5 proxy-url)
PUT /v0/management/proxy-url HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 59


{"value":"socks5://oracle-user:oracle-pass@127.0.0.1:1080"}

### step 2: GET http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/proxy-url (read back)
GET /v0/management/proxy-url HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




### step 3: GET http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/config (full config echo (contains proxy-url))
GET /v0/management/config HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




### step 4: PUT http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/proxy-url (switch to direct)
PUT /v0/management/proxy-url HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 18


{"value":"direct"}

### step 5: DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/proxy-url (delete proxy-url)
DELETE /v0/management/proxy-url HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




### step 6: GET http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/proxy-url (empty after delete)
GET /v0/management/proxy-url HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1



